  "name": "Workflow: Instagram Token Helper",
  "description": null,
  "active": false,
  "isArchived": true,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Instagram Token Helper (Manual HTTP)\n\nEste workflow convierte tu token corto (1 hora)\nen un token largo (60 dias) usando la API directa.\n\n**Necesitas**:\n1. Short Lived Token\n2. App ID (de Facebook Developers)\n3. App Secret (de Facebook Developers)\n\n**Resultado**:\nObtendrás el long_lived_token y tu ig_user_id.",
        "height": 452,
        "width": 380
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        160,
        64
      ],
      "id": "sticky-overview",
      "name": "Nota: Overview"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Paso 1: Prerequisitos\n\n1. Ve a developers.facebook.com\n2. Copia App ID y App Secret de tu App\n3. Genera Short Lived Token en Graph Explorer\n   (permisos: instagram_basic, instagram_content_publish,\n    pages_show_list, pages_read_engagement)",
        "height": 268,
        "width": 340
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        576,
        160
      ],
      "id": "sticky-prereqs",
      "name": "Nota: Prerequisitos"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "manual-trigger",
      "name": "Manual Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        512
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "field-token",
              "name": "short_lived_token",
              "value": "YOUR_SHORT_LIVED_TOKEN",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "field-app-id",
              "name": "app_id",
              "value": "YOUR_APP_ID",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "field-app-secret",
              "name": "app_secret",
              "value": "YOUR_APP_SECRET",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "set-input",
      "name": "Set: Inputs",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        464,
        512
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://graph.facebook.com/v21.0/oauth/access_token",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "grant_type",
              "value": "fb_exchange_token"
            },
            {
              "name": "client_id",
              "value": "={{ $json.app_id }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "client_secret",
              "value": "={{ $json.app_secret }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "fb_exchange_token",
              "value": "={{ $json.short_lived_token }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "http-exchange",
      "name": "HTTP: Exchange Token",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        704,
        512
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://graph.facebook.com/v21.0/me/accounts",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "fields",
              "value": "instagram_business_account,name"
            },
            {
              "name": "access_token",
              "value": "={{ $json.access_token }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "http-get-pages",
      "name": "HTTP: Get Pages",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        944,
        512
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const accounts = $input.first().json.data;\nconst igAccount = accounts.find(acc => acc.instagram_business_account);\n\nif (!igAccount) {\n  throw new Error(\"No se encontró ninguna página de Facebook conectada a una cuenta de Instagram Business.\");\n}\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    ig_user_id: igAccount.instagram_business_account.id,\n    page_name: igAccount.name,\n    long_lived_token: $('HTTP: Exchange Token').item.json.access_token,\n    expires_in: $('HTTP: Exchange Token').item.json.expires_in\n  }\n};"
      },
      "id": "code-find-account",
      "name": "Code: Find IG Account",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1184,
        512
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "res-token",
              "name": "long_lived_token",
              "value": "={{ $json.long_lived_token }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "res-id",
              "name": "ig_user_id",
              "value": "={{ $json.ig_user_id }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "res-page",
              "name": "page_name",
              "value": "={{ $json.page_name }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "res-msg",
              "name": "status",
              "value": "✅ CREAR CREDENCIAL 'instagramApi' USANDO long_lived_token",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "set-result",
      "name": "Set: Resultado Final",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1424,
        512
      ]
    }
  ],
